Meson is the build system used by wayland, libinput, libxkbcommon, mesa and most of
the modern graphics stack. It is pure Python, so this port copies it to
/usr/local/lib/meson and installs a small meson wrapper in /usr/local/bin (no pip
needed). It builds with samurai (ninja) and finds libraries through pkgconf.
upstream: https://mesonbuild.com/
